  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Muranishi and Kuroki roll into a packed Tokyo station square atop their own campaign van, interrupting a major political speech to declare that openness reduces crime and transforms society.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "resident",
      "t": "今立ち上がらなければダメなんです！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "resident",
      "t": "誠実な政治を取り戻し、日本を救うためには何が必要か！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "わたくしのアダルトビデオでございます！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "resident",
      "t": "何これ、もうどうなってるのよこれ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "お待たせいたしました、村西とおるでございます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どれだけ作っても、売りさばく市場が圧倒的に少ないんですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "resident",
      "t": "そんなことしたら世の中がめちゃくちゃになりますよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "大きなお声の奥様だ。時代は変わったんですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "はしたないなんていう常識は崩れつつある。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "立て役者となった女性こそが黒木香君です！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "皆様こんにちは、ごきげんよう。黒木香でございます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "日常と愛をつなぐ存在なんでございます。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "resident",
      "t": "今立ち上がらなければダメなんです！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If we do not stand up right now, it will be too late!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "resident",
      "t": "誠実な政治を取り戻し、日本を救うためには何が必要か！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What is needed to restore honest politics and save Japan!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "わたくしのアダルトビデオでございます！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My adult videos, of course!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "resident",
      "t": "何これ、もうどうなってるのよこれ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What on earth is this, what is going on here!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "お待たせいたしました、村西とおるでございます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sorry to keep you waiting—I am Toru Muranishi!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どれだけ作っても、売りさばく市場が圧倒的に少ないんですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No matter how many films I make, there are far too few outlets to sell them.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "resident",
      "t": "そんなことしたら世の中がめちゃくちゃになりますよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you aired things like that on television, society would fall apart!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "大きなお声の奥様だ。時代は変わったんですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What a loud voice you have, ma'am. Times have changed.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "はしたないなんていう常識は崩れつつある。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The old convention calling desire shameful is crumbling.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "立て役者となった女性こそが黒木香君です！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And the woman who led this change is none other than Kaoru Kuroki!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "皆様こんにちは、ごきげんよう。黒木香でございます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Good afternoon, everyone. I am Kaoru Kuroki.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "日常と愛をつなぐ存在なんでございます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am here to bridge everyday life and human desire.'",
      "gap": 0.65
